imal, not {type(amount).__name__}\")\n\n  Line 30: def parse_money(text: str) -> Decimal:\n\n  Line 31:     \"\"\"``parse_money(\"1,234.50\")`` -> ``Decimal(\"1234.50\")``; currency symbols are ignored.\"\"\"\n\n\n/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--claude-spares-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out2/amend-opencode/dependency-upgrade/opencode-2/repo/requirements.txt:\n  Line 2: moneyfmt==1.4.0\n","metadata":{"matches":31,"truncated":false},"title":"MoneyError|format_money|parse_money|moneyfmt","time":{"start":1794914598272,"end":1794914598305}},"id":"prt_1e93f3d73001f1xDew4zIi45g4","sessionID":"ses_e16c107c3ffeWRlutuHyXKg6HF","messageID":"msg_1e93f0c4100111WZXtY9kr5nIA"}}
