o, the old behavior for render([]) was \"Total\" + 19 spaces + (14-5=9 spaces) + \"€0.00\" → same. ✓\n\nLet me add that test and also verify the old-code equivalence for render([]): old total([]) = 0 → format_money(0, \"EUR\") → Decimal(str(0)) = Decimal(\"0\") → quantize → 0.00 → \"€0.00\". Same output. ✓\n\nLet me add the test.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e9411af8001y6xWYCH3ioeELD","sessionID":"ses_e16c107c3ffeWRlutuHyXKg6HF","messageID":"msg_1e9410af8001Zgmy856Hxkff5U"}}
