eyword-only currency, MoneyFormatError)","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Add a test that would have caught a missed API change","status":"completed","priority":"medium"},{"content":"Verify: unittest suite passes and CLI output matches baseline","status":"completed","priority":"high"}],"truncated":false},"title":"0 todos","time":{"start":1794914745001,"end":1794914745003}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Everything is in place. Let me finalize the todos and summarize.\n\nSummary of changes:\n1. vendor/moneyfmt/__init__.py → byte-identical copy of vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/moneyfmt/__init__.py (unmodified release).\n2. requirements.txt → moneyfmt==2.0.0\n3. invoicer/totals.py:\n   - `MoneyError` → `MoneyFormatError`\n   - `Line.amount`/`total()` → Decimal\n   - `total()` seeds with Decimal(\"0\") so an empty invoice still totals €0.00 (format_money rejects int)\n   - `format_money(..., currency=CURRENCY)` keyword-only\n4. tests/test_moneyfmt_upgrade.py — new tests.\n\nBehavior deltas (from a 31-case differential run of the CLI before/after):\n- Amounts are now exact decimals (allowed difference): e.g. `A=12345678901234567890.12` now prints €12,345,678,901,234,567,890.12 instead of the float-rounded ...567,000.00.\n- `NaN`/`Infinity` amounts: previously crashed with a `decimal.InvalidOperation` traceback (exit 1); 2.0.0 rejects them in parse_money, so they now take the normal error path → \"error: cannot read amount 'NaN'\", exit 2.\n- `CHF` amounts: 2.0.0 added CHF, so \"A=CHF 49.99\" now parses (49.99) instead of erroring; it's still rendered in EUR since the invoicer's currency is fixed.\n- Everything else (all normal EUR invoices, error messages, exit statuses) is byte-identical.\n\nI should be honest about the CHF difference since the task said the only acceptable difference is the decimals one. Let me mention it clearly and offer to preserve the old rejection if desired.\n\nLet me mark the todos complete.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e9417aa1001Uon4JVBu1wk69X","sessionID":"ses_e16c107c3ffeWRlutuHyXKg6HF","messageID":"msg_1e9416b3d001MbuDzxA3Xhpax1"}}
