{"type":"text","timestamp":1794914751457,"sessionID":"ses_e16c107c3ffeWRlutuHyXKg6HF","part":{"id":"prt_1e941827c001EszqqT7RLdlI1C","messageID":"msg_1e9417b19001XBPchc77yBxdRG","sessionID":"ses_e16c107c3ffeWRlutuHyXKg6HF","type":"text","text":"Done. `python -m unittest discover -s tests` → 11 tests, all pass.\n\n**Changes**\n- `vendor/moneyfmt/__init__.py` — byte-identical copy of the released 2.0.0 file (`diff -r` clean against `vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/moneyfmt`).\n- `requirements.txt` — `moneyfmt==2.0.0`.\n- `invoicer/totals.py:8` — `MoneyError` → `MoneyFormatError`; `Line.amount`/`total()` are now `Decimal` (`total()` seeds with `Decimal(\"0\")`, otherwise an empty invoice totals `int 0`, which `format_money` rejects); `format_money(..., currency=CURRENCY)` is keyword-only.\n- `tests/test_moneyfmt_upgrade.py` (new) — asserts the vendored version/error name, Decimal amounts and exact totals, that `render` calls `format_money` with a `Decimal` and `currency=` keyword only (fails loudly if the old call style is used), that unreadable amounts become `InvoiceError`, and CLI exit statuses/output.\n\n**Verification** — I diffed 31 CLI invocations before/after. All normal invoices, error texts and exit codes are identical. Three deltas, all forced by 2.0.0 itself:\n1. Amounts are exact decimals (the allowed difference): `A=12345678901234567890.12` now prints `€12,345,678,901,234,567,890.12` instead of the float-rounded `…567,000.00`.\n2. `NaN`/`Infinity` amounts used to crash with a `decimal.InvalidOperation` traceback (exit 1); 2.0.0 rejects them in `parse_money`, so they now take the normal path → `error: cannot read amount 'NaN'`, exit 2.\n3. 2.0.0 added `CHF`, so `A=CHF 49.99` now parses as 49.99 instead of erroring (still rendered in EUR, since the invoicer's currency is fixed). If you want 1.4.0's \"unknown currency\" rejection preserved, say so and I'll add an explicit guard — I left it alone since rejecting CHF now would mean second-guessing the unmodified vendored release.","time":{"start":1794914747004,"end":1794914751453}}}
